{
  "id": "imagehost",
  "name": { "zh": "图床", "en": "Image host" },
  "version": "0.6.1",
  "entry": "main.wasm",
  "description": {
    "zh": "基于 rclone 的图床：上传图片拿直链，可再换短链。",
    "en": "An rclone-backed image host: upload an image, get a direct link, optionally shorten it."
  },
  "author": "h897105167",
  "tags": {
    "zh": ["图床", "图片", "rclone", "上传", "短链"],
    "en": ["image host", "image", "rclone", "upload", "short link"]
  },
  "platform": "any",
  "builtin": false,
  "http_entry": true,
  "capabilities": ["kv", "ui", "fs", "http", "rclone", "env"],
  "plugin_setting": {
    "version": 2,
    "summary": {
      "zh": "把本地图片传到 rclone 远程，生成直链；需要时再换一条短链。",
      "en": "Upload a local image to an rclone remote and get a direct link; shorten it when you want."
    },
    "on_start": "state",
    "on_exit": "exit",
    "controls": [
      {
        "kind": "group",
        "key": "g-title",
        "label": {
          "zh": "图床工具（上传 → 直链 → 短链）",
          "en": "Image host (upload → direct link → short link)"
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "field",
        "key": "remote",
        "label": { "zh": "存储的远程", "en": "Storage remote" },
        "field": "select",
        "dynamic": true,
        "width": 260,
        "line": "s1",
        "placeholder": { "zh": "选择一个 rclone 远程", "en": "Pick an rclone remote" }
      },
      {
        "kind": "action",
        "key": "refresh-remotes",
        "label": { "zh": "刷新远程", "en": "Refresh remotes" },
        "style": "secondary",
        "line": "s1"
      },
      {
        "kind": "field",
        "key": "path",
        "label": { "zh": "上传目录", "en": "Upload dir" },
        "field": "path",
        "width": 430,
        "line": "s2",
        "placeholder": {
          "zh": "留空 = 远程根，如 image_bed",
          "en": "Empty = remote root, e.g. image_bed"
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "field",
        "key": "upload_path",
        "label": { "zh": "上传图片路径", "en": "Image path" },
        "field": "text",
        "width": 330,
        "line": "s3",
        "placeholder": {
          "zh": "本机图片文件的完整路径",
          "en": "Full path of a local image file"
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "action",
        "key": "pick",
        "label": { "zh": "选择文件…", "en": "Choose file…" },
        "style": "secondary",
        "line": "s3",
        "dialog_title": { "zh": "选择要上传的图片", "en": "Choose the image to upload" },
        "filters": ["png", "jpg", "jpeg", "gif", "webp", "bmp"]
      },
      {
        "kind": "field",
        "key": "dedupe",
        "label": { "zh": "去重", "en": "Deduplicate" },
        "field": "bool",
        "default": "true",
        "line": "s4"
      },
      {
        "kind": "hint",
        "key": "dedupe-tip",
        "text": {
          "zh": "去重：上传目录里已有同名文件就提示并取消上传（不勾选则自动改名成「名字 (1).png」）。",
          "en": "Deduplicate: if the upload dir already holds a file with the same name, warn and cancel the upload (unticked, the new file is renamed to “name (1).png”)."
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "field",
        "key": "short_tpl",
        "label": { "zh": "短链模板", "en": "Short-link template" },
        "field": "select",
        "options": [
          { "value": "不选择", "label": { "zh": "不选择", "en": "None" } },
          { "value": "模板一", "label": { "zh": "模板一", "en": "Template 1" } }
        ],
        "width": 140,
        "line": "s5"
      },
      {
        "kind": "group",
        "key": "g-tpl1",
        "label": { "zh": "模板一参数", "en": "Template 1 settings" }
      },
      {
        "kind": "field",
        "key": "short_fmt",
        "label": { "zh": "返回格式", "en": "Response format" },
        "field": "select",
        "options": [{ "value": "无", "label": { "zh": "无", "en": "None" } }, "JSON", "JSONP"],
        "width": 110,
        "line": "t1"
      },
      {
        "kind": "field",
        "key": "short_method",
        "label": { "zh": "请求方式", "en": "Method" },
        "field": "select",
        "options": ["GET", "POST"],
        "width": 100,
        "line": "t1"
      },
      {
        "kind": "field",
        "key": "short_rate",
        "label": { "zh": "每秒上限", "en": "Per-second limit" },
        "field": "number",
        "width": 90,
        "line": "t1",
        "placeholder": "4"
      },
      {
        "kind": "field",
        "key": "short_callback",
        "label": { "zh": "JSONP 回调", "en": "JSONP callback" },
        "field": "text",
        "width": 120,
        "line": "t1",
        "placeholder": "callback"
      },
      {
        "kind": "field",
        "key": "short_url",
        "label": { "zh": "请求地址", "en": "Endpoint" },
        "field": "text",
        "width": 260,
        "line": "t2",
        "placeholder": "http://api.ft12.com/api.php"
      },
      {
        "kind": "field",
        "key": "short_key",
        "label": "api_key",
        "field": "password",
        "width": 300,
        "line": "t2",
        "placeholder": {
          "zh": "模板一必须填 api_key",
          "en": "Template 1 requires an api_key"
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "hint",
        "key": "short-tip",
        "text": {
          "zh": "模板一：请求地址 + url + apikey；返回格式「无」表示服务端直接回纯文本链接。填好后点「保存设置」记住。",
          "en": "Template 1: endpoint + url + apikey; the “None” response format means the service returns a plain-text link. Click “Save settings” to keep it."
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "group",
        "key": "g-http",
        "label": {
          "zh": "HTTP 上传服务（给外部客户端）",
          "en": "HTTP upload service (for external clients)"
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "field",
        "key": "max_mb",
        "label": { "zh": "体积上限 MB", "en": "Size limit MB" },
        "field": "number",
        "width": 90,
        "line": "h1",
        "placeholder": "20"
      },
      {
        "kind": "field",
        "key": "compress",
        "label": { "zh": "超限先压缩", "en": "Compress oversized first" },
        "field": "bool",
        "default": "true",
        "line": "h1"
      },
      {
        "kind": "action",
        "key": "detect-port",
        "label": { "zh": "检测服务", "en": "Detect service" },
        "style": "secondary",
        "line": "h1"
      },
      {
        "kind": "field",
        "key": "http_url",
        "label": { "zh": "上传地址", "en": "Upload URL" },
        "field": "text",
        "width": 430,
        "line": "h2",
        "placeholder": {
          "zh": "点「检测服务」自动填写",
          "en": "Filled in by “Detect service”"
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "hint",
        "key": "http-tip",
        "text": {
          "zh": "端口在「设置」页里配置（默认 5273，被占用会提示），勾上「随程序启动」后每次启动都会拉起这个上传服务。外部客户端探测 http://127.0.0.1:<端口>/plugin/imagehost/ping，上传走 POST /plugin/imagehost/upload。超过体积上限的图会先压缩再传；选了短链模板就返回短链，取不到时自动回退直链。",
          "en": "The port lives on the Settings page (default 5273, a busy port is reported). With “start with the app” ticked this upload service starts on every launch. External clients probe http://127.0.0.1:<port>/plugin/imagehost/ping and upload via POST /plugin/imagehost/upload. Images over the size limit are compressed first; if a short-link template is chosen the short link is returned, with a fallback to the direct link."
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "action",
        "key": "run",
        "label": { "zh": "生成直链", "en": "Generate direct link" },
        "style": "primary",
        "line": "b1"
      },
      {
        "kind": "action",
        "key": "save",
        "label": { "zh": "保存设置", "en": "Save settings" },
        "style": "secondary",
        "line": "b1"
      },
      {
        "kind": "action",
        "key": "copy-link",
        "label": { "zh": "复制直链", "en": "Copy direct link" },
        "style": "secondary",
        "line": "b1"
      },
      {
        "kind": "field",
        "key": "last_link",
        "label": { "zh": "直链", "en": "Direct link" },
        "field": "text",
        "width": 430,
        "line": "r1",
        "placeholder": { "zh": "上传后在这里显示", "en": "Shown here after upload" }
      },
      {
        "kind": "action",
        "key": "copy-short",
        "label": { "zh": "复制短链", "en": "Copy short link" },
        "style": "secondary",
        "line": "r2"
      },
      {
        "kind": "field",
        "key": "last_short",
        "label": { "zh": "短链", "en": "Short link" },
        "field": "text",
        "width": 430,
        "line": "r2",
        "placeholder": {
          "zh": "选「模板一」并上传后会在这里显示",
          "en": "Shown here after choosing “Template 1” and uploading"
        }
      },
      { "kind": "status", "key": "state", "text": { "zh": "状态", "en": "Status" }, "lamp": true },
      {
        "kind": "hint",
        "key": "link-tip",
        "text": {
          "zh": "直链来源：K-Vault 等站点型远程由 rclone 上传后直接给出站点链接；普通远程退回本机服务的代理链接 http://127.0.0.1:<port>/plugin/imagehost/i/<远程>:<路径>，需要本程序在运行。",
          "en": "Where the direct link comes from: for site-style remotes (K-Vault etc.) rclone returns the site link right after upload; for plain remotes it falls back to this app's proxy link http://127.0.0.1:<port>/plugin/imagehost/i/<remote>:<path>, which needs the app running."
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
